    <string name="about_body">Parakeet v3 on your phone. Audio stays local.\n\nRecord voice notes, search past transcriptions, and save portable Cassini Opus documents with audio and timed words.\n\nAudio up to 2 hours, speakers labelled and recognised on the phone (voices never leave it), automatic multilingual recognition. The current transcript language label is Italian.\n\nGPLv3. Source and dependency notices: github.com/codemyriad/cassini-android</string>
